{{#isFseVariant}}
This theme takes full advantage of the WordPress block editor and Site Editor, allowing you to customize every aspect of your site using blocks. No coding knowledge required!
{{/isFseVariant}}

{{#isClassicVariant}}
This theme follows WordPress best practices and provides a solid foundation for building custom websites with traditional PHP templates.
