== Frequently Asked Questions ==

{{#isFseVariant}}
= How do I customize the header and footer? =
Use the Site Editor (Appearance > Editor) to edit the header and footer template parts. You can modify these using blocks without touching any code.

= Can I change colors and fonts? =
Yes! Go to Appearance > Editor > Styles to customize colors, typography, and other design elements.

= How do I create custom page layouts? =
In the Site Editor, go to Templates and either edit existing templates or create new ones using blocks.
{{/isFseVariant}}

{{#isClassicVariant}}
= How do I add a custom logo? =
Go to Appearance > Customize > Site Identity and upload your logo.

= How do I set up navigation menus? =
Go to Appearance > Menus to create and customize your navigation menus, then assign them in Appearance > Customize > Menus.

= Can I add widgets to the sidebar? =
Yes! Go to Appearance > Widgets to add content to the sidebar area.
{{/isClassicVariant}}

{{#withBlocks}}
= How do I use the custom blocks? =
The custom blocks will appear in the block editor when editing posts or pages. Look for them in the block inserter or search by name.

= Can I modify the custom blocks? =
Yes! The block files are located in the theme directory and can be customized to fit your needs.
{{/withBlocks}}

